; scenes/characters/Character.tscn in Kenney's humanFemaleA skin; her chant
; is the Chant child (scripts/npc/madhuri_chant.gd), a positional loop that
; rises when the player hums. PLACEHOLDER: replaced by Madhuri of GDD §4
; "Characters", and the chant by the recorded maha-mantra of GDD §10 "Sound".

